WEBVTT

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:30.016
(Laughter)

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:33.920
But the oxytocin-producing
friendships have ...

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:39.816
They feel spiritual
because it's a heart opening, right?

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:41.560
You know, we go deep. And --

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:47.840
I find that I shed tears a lot
with my intimate friends.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:54.336
Not because I'm sad but because
I'm so touched and inspired by them.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:56.640
LT: And you know one of you
is going to go soon.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:00.280
(Laughter)